{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QbQNujH6ryNksdgext2pBw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the task carefully:\n\n1. I need to create unit tests for the `pkg/format` package\n2. Three test files: `color_test.go`, `column_test.go`, `size_test.go`\n3. I need to read the PRD first to understand the requirements\n\nLet me start by reading the required reading files that aren't already provided in the source code above. The source code for `color.go`, `column.go`, `size.go`, and `difftest_test.go` are already provided. I need to read:\n- `docs/specs/product-requirements/prd003-format.yaml`\n\n\n- `docs/specs/test-suites/test-rel00.0.yaml` (checking the file list for the correct naming)\n\nLet me read those files to understand the requirements and test specifications.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":30598,"cache_read_input_tokens":16066,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":30598},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6da3cead-c54c-43e9-b4b7-94f8344225ed","uuid":"34c304b8-f0df-462e-ae7a-cdf5dc391ed3"}
